    {
      "turn": 2,
      "doctor_question": "How has your sleep been lately?",
      "targeted_symptom": null,
      "patient_response": "My sleep? Oh, I haven't really noticed any problems with it. I guess it's fine. I usually head to bed right after we watch the evening news. Though I tell you, watching the news these days is enough to get anybody riled up. Just last night they were going on about that new highway expansion over on Route 9. I actually helped pour the concrete for the original overpass there back in '88. Man, that was a brutal summer. We had guys dropping from the heat left and right because the site foreman was a real hard-ass about taking breaks. I always made sure my guys had their thermoses full, though. You can't mess around with that kind of heat when you're out there hauling rebar all day. But, uh... what was the question? Oh, right, sleep. Yeah, no, I sleep just regular, I'd say.",
